Package: rtemis.draw
Title: Interactive Visualization
Version: 0.5.3
Date: 2026-09-28
Authors@R:
    person(given = "E.D.", family = "Gennatas", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "gennatas@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9280-3609"))
Description: Create interactive visualizations with 'ECharts', 'Sigma.js',
    and 'MapLibre'. High-level plotting functions and low-level configuration
    use type-checked, validated 'S7' objects. Visualizations render through
    'htmlwidgets' with automatic light/dark themes, integrate with 'Quarto'
    and 'shiny', and support Scalable Vector Graphics (SVG) output.
URL: https://www.rtemis.org, https://docs.rtemis.org/r/draw, https://docs.rtemis.org/r/draw-api
BugReports: https://github.com/rtemis-org/draw/issues
